    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Both solutions should work. But in one case we do extra calls on methods that we don't have to explicitly bind. With the suggested approach we only bound the public API the rest comes for free (we don't tweak the instance). Either we re-use the instance like the previous comment or we explicitly bind the **all** public API to the `widget` instance (would probably go for this solution).",
